---
import MediaSlot from '../MediaSlot.astro';
import RulesArt from '../art/RulesArt.astro';
import Logo from '../Logo.astro';
---
<section class="section feature" id="rules" aria-labelledby="rules-title">
	<div class="container split">
		<div class="copy head">
			<p class="eyebrow">04 — Project rules and context</p>
			<h2 id="rules-title">Your project's rules, <span class="muted">in every request.</span></h2>
			<p class="lede">
				Put how your project works in <code>.siriusrules</code>, <code>.sirius/rules.md</code> or <code>AGENTS.md</code>
				— the build commands, the conventions, what never to touch — and Sirius reads it before it answers. The file in
				front of you travels with each request as context, so you ask about the code you are looking at without
				pasting it.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="demo">
			<MediaSlot name="project-rules" label="A .siriusrules file open in Sirius, the three rule files it reads, and the chat input carrying the current file as context."><RulesArt /></MediaSlot>
		</div>
		<div class="copy more">
			<ul class="points">
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>Three files, one of them shared.</b> <code>.siriusrules</code> and <code>.sirius/rules.md</code> are Sirius's own; <code>AGENTS.md</code> is the convention other agents read too, so one file can steer them all.</div></li>
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>Ambient context, no ceremony.</b> The active editor — file, selection, position — is supplied automatically, with the editor's own context controls to add or remove more.</div></li>
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>Rules never block.</b> A missing or unreadable rules file never stops a request; the agent simply works without it.</div></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "demo head" "demo more"; column-gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); row-gap: 1.75rem; align-items: center; }
	.head { grid-area: head; align-self: end; }
	.more { grid-area: more; align-self: start; }
	.demo { grid-area: demo; }
	.copy h2 { margin-top: 1rem; }
	.copy .lede { margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: var(--text-m); }
	.points { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
	.points li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 20px 1fr; gap: 0.85rem; align-items: start; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: var(--text-s); line-height: 1.55; }
	.points b { color: var(--fg); }
	.points :global(.pt-icon) { margin-top: 0.3em; }
	@media (max-width: 900px) { .split { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "head" "demo" "more"; row-gap: 2.25rem; } }
</style>
